#. module: dwo_sla_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dwo_sla_core.view_sla_definition_form
msgid ""
"Avoid three common mistakes: a Start\n"
"                                        Condition that is a subset of the Stop\n"
"                                        Condition (the SLA never attaches); a\n"
"                                        Pause Condition that is a subset of the\n"
"                                        Start Condition (the task attaches\n"
"                                        paused and is cancelled when the pause\n"
"                                        ends); Start and Pause Conditions that\n"
"                                        are mutually exclusive (the task is\n"
"                                        cancelled before it can pause)."
msgstr ""
"避けるべき3つの誤り: 開始条件が\n"
"                                        停止条件の部分集合である（SLAが適用されない）。\n"
"                                        一時停止条件が開始条件の部分集合である\n"
"                                        （タスクが一時停止状態で適用され、\n"
"                                        一時停止の終了時にキャンセルされる）。\n"
"                                        開始条件と一時停止条件が\n"
"                                        互いに排他的である\n"
"                                        （タスクが一時停止する前に\n"
"                                        キャンセルされる）。"

